1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Margaret Plantagenet1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #104553, b. 1327, d. before 1352
2 CONT
2 CONT      Margaret Plantagenet was born in 1327.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She was the daughter of Edmund of Woodstock, 1st Earl of Kent and Margaret Wake, Baroness Wake of Liddell.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She married Amanco d'Albret, Seigneur d'Albret of Gascony.
2 CONT
2 CONT  She died before 1352
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p10456.htm#i104553
