2 CONT * 3.[S5] Douglas Richardson, Plantagenet Ancestry, p. 687-689.
2 CONT * 4.[S16] Douglas Richardson, Magna Carta Ancestry, 2nd Edition, Vol. II, p. 43.
2 CONT * 5.[S4] Douglas Richardson, Royal Ancestry, Vol. II, p. 419.
2 CONT * 6.[S11568] The Complete Peerage of England, Scotland, Ireland, Great Britain, and the United Kingdom, by George Edward Cokayne, Vol. VII, p. 110.
