2 CONT
2 CONT From "The Mortimer Family of Wigmore: An outline lineage" by Ian Mortimer, Version 3.0, 16 June 2016 < [https://www.mortimer.co.uk/family/outlinelineage.pdf PDF] >. Page 46.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Sir Jean de Mortemer, seigneur of Couhé, who first married Indie de l’Isle-Jourdain in 1366. He married secondly, in 1405, Aliénor de Périgord (d. 1434). If this is indeed the same man, he must by then have been in his twilight
2 CONC  years. By his first wife (supposedly) he had issue:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Jean de Mortemer, seigneur of Couhé. See below.
2 CONT ----
