1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Isabelle de Lusignan was born on 1234 in Angouleme, Charent, France to Hugh X De Lusignan, Count de la March and Isabella D'Angouleme.  Isabelle married (1.) Geoffrey de Rancon, Seigneur de Taillebourg on 1252.  Is
2 CONC abelle married (2.) Maurice IV de Craon, Seigneur de Craon on 1255.  She passed away on January 14, 1298/99.
