1 NAME Jacques /de Durfort/
2 GIVN Jacques
2 SURN de Durfort
2 _MARNM de Durfort
2 NICK Jacques de Durfort Seigneur de Duras
2 NICK Marquis de Duras
2 NICK Comte de Rauzan
2 NICK Baron de Blanquefort Seigneur de Pujols
1 NAME Jacques de Durfort, marquis de Duras
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1547
1 BAPM
2 DATE 21 FEB 1547
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 APR 1626
2 ADDR
3 CITY Duras
3 STAE Aquitaine
3 CTRY France
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00024682&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Jacques was baptised at Duras on 21 February 1547, the son of Symphorien de Durfort, seigneur de Duras, and Barbe Cauchon de Maupas. In 1587 he succeeded his elder brother Jean as lord of Duras.
2 CONT
2 CONT About 20 May 1603 Jacques married Marguerite de Montgommery, dame de Lorges, daughter of Comte Jacques de Montgommery, seigneur de Lorges, and Pernelle de Champagne-le-Suse. They had two sons of whom Guy I would have progeny. Marg
2 CONC uerite died in 1606.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacques was captain of 50 men-at-arms of the French permanent forces _(hommes des ordonnances du roi)._ In February 1609 he was created Marquis de Duras by King Henri IV, and councillor of state on 12 March that year. He was raise
2 CONC d to Comte de Rozan by King Louis XIII on 25 October 1625.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacques died of apoplexy at Duras on 3 April 1626, aged 79.
