1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Our Royal, Noble, Titled and Commoner Ancestors and Cousins [https://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p1328.htm#i39887 Agnes (Agathe) de Lusignan]1,2
2 CONT [1] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. III, Tafel 564.
2 CONT [2] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XIII, Tafel 70.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====FMG: [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/ANGOULEME.htm#HuguesXLusignandied1249B Angoulême, La Marche, Perigord]
2 CONT * 1. '''HUGUES''' [XI] '''"le Brun" de Lusignan''' ([before 1188]-Damietta 1249 after 15 Jan, bur Abbaye de Valence)....'''m''' ([10 Mar/22 May] 1220) as her second husband, '''ISABELLE Ctss d’Angoulême''', widow of JOHN King of E
2 CONC ngland, daughter of AYMAR “Taillefer” Comte d’Angoulême & his wife Alix de Courtenay ([1187]-Fontevrault Abbey 31 May 1246, bur Fontevrault Abbey). '''Comte Hugues [XI] & his wife had nine children:''',,,
2 CONT ** b) '''AGNES''' [Agathe] '''de Lusignan''' (-after 7 Apr 1269). The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet been identified. '''m''' (before 1243) [https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/poiteast.htm#Guill
2 CONC aumeIIChauvignydied1271 '''GUILLAUME''' [II] '''de Chauvigny'''] Seigneur de Châteauroux et de la Châtre d'Argenton, son of GUILLAUME [I] de Chauvigny Seigneur de Châteauroux & his [first/second] wife --- (-Palermo 3 Jan 1271).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes\Agathe de Lusignan was born on 1223 in France to Hugh X De Lusignan, Count de la March and Isabella D'Angouleme De Lusignan.  Agnes\Agathe married Guillaume II de Chauvigny, Sr. de Chateauroux and had a child:  Guillaume III
2 CONC  de Chauvigny, Lord of Chateauroux.  She passed away AFTER April 7, 1269.
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes\Agathe de Lusignan de Chauvigny is my 26th great aunt.
2 CONT
