2 CONT e)       '''  CECILE de Beaufort ''' (-1410).  A manuscript genealogy of the Beaufort family (date not specified) names “Elionordim dominam de Belliloco, Margaritam dominam de Poliniaco, Ceciliam comitissam Valentin. et Diens., Io
2 CONC annam dominam de Baucio et comitissam Avelini, quæ postea nupsit Guidoni de Chavigny” as the four daughters of “Guillelmus comes Bellifortis et vicecomes Turenæ, uxorem...Alienordim de Convenis”[1685].  An enquiry dated 1421 recor
2 CONC ds that "feu Comte de Valentinois" married "messire Raimon de Tureine…la suer"[1686].  Documents dated 1404 name "Loys de Poitiers Comte de Valentinois et de Dioys" and "madame Cecile femme dudit comte"[1687].  An enquiry dated 14
2 CONC 21 concerning the succession of "le Comte de Valentinois" who died in Jul 1419 records that his first wife died in 1410[1688]. 
2 CONT
