1 NAME Sibylle /des Baux/
2 GIVN Sibylle
2 SURN des Baux
1 SEX F
1 BURI
2 PLAC Marseille, église des Franciscains
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 JUL 1362
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT - http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/NEAPOLITAN%20NOBILITY.htm#SibylleBuaxdied1361
2 CONT
2 CONT d)         SIBYLLE de Baux (-before 16 May 1361, bur Marseille, église des Franciscains).  The testament of "Dominus Jacobus de Sabaudia Princeps Achayæ filius et hæres…Domini Philippi de Sabaudia Principis Achayæ quondam" dated 1
2 CONC 6 May 1366 names "Philippum eius filium, quem suscepit a D. Sibilla de Baucio eius conjuge…"[314].  The primary source which confirms her parentage more precisely has not yet been identified.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (contract 9 Jun 1339) as his second wife, JACQUES de Savoie Signore di Piemonte titular Prince of Achaia, son of PHILIPPE de Savoie Prince of Achaia & his second wife Catherine de Viennois ([6/16] Jan 1315-Pinerolo 14 May 
2 CONC 1367). 
2 CONT
