2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Mahaut du Perche, born Bet. 1100 and 1105 in Perche, Normandy, France; died 18 May 1143. She was the daughter of 6. Geoffrey du Perche et Mortaigne I and 7. Beatrice de Montdidier.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Raymond de Turenne and Mahaut du Perche are:
2 CONT
2 CONT  1 i. Marguerite de Turenne, born 1117 in France; died Aft. 1201; married (1) Ademir de Limoges IV Bef. 1140; married (2) Ebles de Ventadour II Abt. 1140; married (3) William Taillefer d'Angouleme IV 1147.
2 CONT
2 CONT   ii. Boson de Turenne
2 CONT
