2 CONC 1200 at Bordeaux Cathedral, Bordeaux, Gironde, France. As of 24 August 1200,her married name was Plantagenet. Isabella of Angouleme Queen of England died on 31 May 1246 at Fontevraud, Maine-et-Loire, France.
