1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Alain d' Albret, Vicomte de Tartas & Limoges, Comte de Gavre'''1,2,3
2 CONT Last Edited	15 Apr 2014
2 CONT M, #59701
2 CONT Father	Jean d' Albret, Sire de Tartas4 d. 3 Jan 1468
2 CONT Mother	Catherine de Rohan4 d. a 24 Mar 1471
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia
2 CONT '''     A contract for the marriage of Alain d' Albret, Vicomte de Tartas & Limoges, Comte de Gavre and Francoise de Blois was signed on 24 November 1456'''.5,2,3 '''Alain d' Albret, Vicomte de Tartas & Limoges, Comte de Gavre lef
2 CONC t a will on 1 October 1522'''.3
2 CONT '''Family'''
2 CONT '''Francoise de Blois''' d. 16 Dec 1481
2 CONT '''Children'''	
