2 CONC her to crush the revolt[700].  The testament of “Hugo dux Burgundiæ”, dated Sep 1272, bequeathed property to “Margaretam filiam meam vicecomitissam Lemovicensem”[701].  A fragment written by Bernard Guidonis records that "domina M
