2 CONT e)         MARGUERITE di Durazzo (1347-Acqua della Mela, near San Severino di Salerno 6 Aug 1412, bur Salerno, San Francesco Cathedral).  Crowned Queen of Sicily 25 Nov 1382 at Naples.  Vicar-General of the Kingdom 16 Apr 1384-31 
2 CONC Jan 1385, and Sep 1385-Mar 1387.  Tutrice for her son King Ladislas.  
