2 CONT '''     Louis II, 3rd Duke de Bourbon was born on 4 August 1337. He married Anne d' Auvergne, daughter of''' Beroald II d' Auvergne, Dauphin d'Clermont-en-Auvergne and Jeanne de Forez, '''on 19 August 1371. Louis II, 3rd Duke de B
2 CONC ourbon died on 19 August 1410 at Montlucon, France, at age 73.'''
