2 DATE BEF 1329
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/AUVERGNE.htm#_Toc55890171
2 CONT
2 CONT i)      '''    BEATRIX de Roche-en-Régnier ''' (after 1298-before 1329).  The testament of “Dauphine dame de Roche, femme de...Guigue sire de Roche”, dated 25 Sep 1323, named “sa fille Béatrice femme de...Marquesius de Canilhac” a
2 CONC s her universal heir[1622].  Felgères notes her parentage and marriage, stating that Marquès de Canilhac was recorded as widower of Béatrix in a charter dated 1329[1623].  “Aliénore de Canilhac femme de Briand de Retourtour seigne
2 CONC ur de Belcastel” confirmed her renunciation of the succession of “Béatrix de Roche dame de Canhilac sa mère, que de Dauphine de la Tour jadis femme dudit sire de Roche sa grand-mère” by charter dated 16 Mar 1348[1624].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (after 1315?) as his second wife, MARQUES Seigneur de Canilhac, son of MARQUES Seigneur de Canilhac & his wife Eléonore d’Apchier (-[1350/59]). 
