1 OCCU Vicomte de Béarn, de Gabarret y de Brulhois, y Señor de Moncada y Castevieil, Vicegreve i Béarn, Vizconde de Bearn, Oloron, Brulhès y Gabardà (1223-1229) y señor de la baronia de Castellví de Rosanes (1228-1229)
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/gascbebig.htm#GuillenIIIMoncadadied1229
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.         GUILLEN de Moncada ([1185]-1229).  The Annals of Surita record that "Don Guillen de Moncada, hijo de Don Guillen Ramon de Moncada y de Donna Guillelma de Casteluell, que caso con la viscondessa de Bearne" was not presen
2 CONC t at the battle of Muret in 1213 but sent messengers to the king[116].  This source confuses Guillen with his paternal grandfather, in relation to the marriage with the heiress of Béarn, which would be impossible from a chronologi
2 CONC cal point of view.  He became an active member of a coalition of barons which became a council of regency for don Jaime I King of Aragon, Conde de Barcelona, in Sep 1216[117].  He was appointed procurator for Catalonia by Jul 1219
2 CONC [118], but fell into conflict with King Jaime [1221].  "Guillermus Raymundi de Montecatano vicecomes Bearnensis" issued a charter for the church of Tarragona dated 27 Feb 1223, which names "Guillermi filii mei" and refers to the t
2 CONC estament of "bonæ memoriæ fratris mei Gastonis vicecomitis Bearnensis"[119].  He succeeded his father in 1224 as GUILLAUME [II] Vicomte de Béarn et d’Oloron.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' GERSENDE de Provence, daughter of ALFONSO de Aragón Comte de Provence & his wife Gersende de Sabran Ctss de Forcalquier.  “Garsindis comitissa mater Gastonis...vicecomitis Bearni” agreed the marriage contract between “dict
2 CONC um dominum Gastonem...Marguaritam filiam” and “Rogerium...comitem Fuxensem et vicecomitem Castri-boni...Rogerium Bernardi filium”, dated 14 Oct 1252[120].  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not yet b
2 CONC een identified.  
2 CONT  Guillaume [II] & his wife had [three] children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------
2 CONT --------
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Guillén de Moncada III, Vicomte de Béarn
