2 CONT
2 CONT i)      '''    LOUISE de Poitiers''' (-after 1400).  The marriage contract between "Humbert de Villars fils de Humbert seigneur de Villars" and "Loyse fille de Loys de Poitiers Comte de Valentinois" is dated 3 Nov 1381[1484].  "Hu
2 CONC mbert sire de Thoire et de Villars" appointed “Odo de Villars chevalier” as proxy to negotiate the marriage between “son fils Humbert de Villars” and “Louise fille de Louis de Poitiers comte de Valentinois” by charter dated 12 Sep
2 CONC  1389[1485].  The marriage contract between "Humbert de Villars fils de Humbert sire de Villars" and “Louise fille de Louis de Poitiers comte de Valentinois et de Diois” is dated 15 Nov 1389[1486].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' (contract 3 Nov 1381, contract 15 Nov 1389) HUMBERT [VII] de Thoire et Villars, son of HUMBERT [VI] Seigneur de Thoire et de Villars & his second wife Marie de Genève (-1400 after 10 Mar). 
2 CONT
