2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jean Janvre, sgr. de La Bouchetière'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ''IX. Jean Janvre, 1st of the name, sgr. de La Bouchetière, married Dlle. Lectice de Surgères, daur. of Guillaume Maengot, sgr. de Surgères and Dampierre, and of his wife, Dame Berthoumée d'Allemoigne, and left a son Archam-baud, 
2 CONC who succeeds, X.[p.46]'' 
2 CONT
2 CONT REF: All Huguenot Pedigrees, Vol. 1
