2 CONC ensis names " Rotaldum eiusdem loci comitem et Iulainam de Aquila matrem regine Navarrensis, et Margaretam uxorem Gisleberti de Novo-burgo" as children, incorrectly, of "Rotaldo comiti de Pertica" & his wife Beatrix de Roucy, spec
2 CONC ifying that Marguerite had children "Rotaldum Ebrodiensem episcopum cum aliis liberis utriusque sexus"[2365].  “Henricus…Warwicense consul et Margareta uxor mea et Rogerus noster filius” donated property to Warwick St Mary by unda
2 CONC ted charter[2366].  The 1130 Pipe Roll records "comitisse de Warwic" in Wiltshire[2367].  1156.  The necrology of the church of Evreux records the death "27 Aug" of "Margarita mater Rotrodi episcopi"[2368].  m HENRI de Beaumont Ea
