4 CONC d. of Sir Ralph de Valletort) dau. of Sir Walter de Bath, parents of Philip (a priest), Sir Richard (m. Joan _), Sir Walter, Isabel, & Joan (m. Richard de Champernoun & Sir Peter de Fissacre) of Cornwall
