2 CONT           o Jimena, a.k.a. Eixemena -> married Roger III, Count of Foix
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Second wife, Almodis
2 CONT
2 CONT     * Third wife, Douce or Dolça de Gévaudaun, heiress of Provence, d. ca. 1127
2 CONT           o Almodis -> married Ponce de Cervera, mother of Agalbursa, who married Barisone II of Arborea
2 CONT           o Berenguela or Berengaria, b. 1116, d. 1149 -> married Alfonso VII of Castile
2 CONT           o Ramon Berenguer IV, Count of Barcelona, b. 1115, d. 1162
2 CONT           o Berenguer Ramon I, Count of Provence, b. ca. 1115, d. 1144
2 CONT           o Bernat -> died young
2 CONT
