2 CONT F, #64308, '''d. 16 December 1481'''
2 CONT Father	Guillaume de Blois, Vicomte de Limoges, Seigneur d'Avesnes & Nouvion-en-Thierache4,3 d. 30 Sep 1454
2 CONT Mother	Isabeau (Isabelle) de la Tour4,3 d. 8 Sep 1488
2 CONT Charts	14 Generation Pedigree of Friedrich Wilhelm III, King of Prussia
2 CONT '''     A contract for the marriage of Francoise de Blois and Alain d' Albret, Vicomte de Tartas & Limoges, Comte de Gavre was signed on 24 November 1456.1,2,3 Francoise de Blois left a will on 1 December 1481.3 She died on 16 Dec
2 CONC ember 1481'''.1,2,3
