2 CONT
2 CONT Charlotte d'Albret was born in 1481. She married Cesare Borgia, son of Rodrigo Borgia and Vannozza dei Cattanei. She died in 1514.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Her married name became Borgia.
2 CONT
