2 CONT '''Father'''	Charles, Duke of Bourbon, Duke d'Auvergne, Grand Marshal of France, Governor of Languedoc, Count of Clermont1 b. 1401, d. 4 Dec 1456
2 CONT '''Mother'''	Agnes of Burgundy1 b. 1407, d. 1 Dec 1476
2 CONT '''     Jean II, 6th Duke de Bourbon, 3rd Duke d'Auvergne was born in 1426.1 He married Jeanne of France''', daughter of Charles VII 'the Victorious", King of France and Marie d' Anjou, '''on 11 March 1447 at Chateau de Moulins le
2 CONC z Tours, France.2 Jean II, 6th Duke de Bourbon, 3rd Duke d'Auvergne married Catherine d' Armagnac''', daughter of Jacques d' Armagnac, 2nd Duke of Nemours, Comte de la Marche & de Mardiac and Louise d' Anjou, '''on 28 August 1484 
2 CONC at St. Cloud, France.1 Jean II, 6th Duke de Bourbon, 3rd Duke d'Auvergne married Jeanne 'the Beautiful' de Bourbon''', daughter of Jean II de Bourbon, Comte de Vendome and Isabel Beauvieu, '''circa June 1487.3 Jean II, 6th Duke de
2 CONC  Bourbon, 3rd Duke d'Auvergne died on 1 April 1488 at Chateau de Moulins, France; Buried at Souvigny.'''1
