2 CONT '''     Vladislav IV 'Jagiellon', King of Bohemia & Hungary was born on 1 March 1456.1 He married Barbara von Brandenburg''', daughter of Albrecht Achilles, Elector of Brandenburg and Anna of Saxony, '''on 20 August 1476 at Frankf
2 CONC urt an der Oder, Germany.1 Vladislav IV 'Jagiellon', King of Bohemia & Hungary married Beatrice of Naples''', daughter of Ferrante (Fernando) I, King of Naples and Isabel de Clermont, '''on 4 October 1490; Secretly married.1 Vladi
2 CONC slav IV 'Jagiellon', King of Bohemia & Hungary and Barbara von Brandenburg were divorced on 7 April 1500 at Rome, Italy.1 Vladislav IV 'Jagiellon', King of Bohemia & Hungary and Beatrice of Naples were divorced on 7 April 1500.1 V
2 CONC ladislav IV 'Jagiellon', King of Bohemia & Hungary married Anna de Foix''', daughter of Gaston II de Foix, Comte de Kendal & Benauges and Catherine de Foix, '''on 6 October 1502.2 Vladislav IV 'Jagiellon', King of Bohemia & Hungar
2 CONC y died on 13 March 1516 at age 60.'''1
2 CONT '''Family 1'''
2 CONT '''Barbara von Brandenburg''' b. 29 May 1464, d. 4 Sep 1515
2 CONT '''Family 2'''
