1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duc_de_La_Rochefoucauld:
2 CONT
2 CONT François IV de La Rochefoucauld (1554 - 15 March 1591) (son of François III de La Rochefoucauld). Comte de La Rochefoucauld, prince de Marcillac, comte de Roucy, baron de Verteuil, etc. Married with Claude d'Estissac (27 September
2 CONC  1587). Protestant, he was killed at Saint-Yrieix by the Catholic League (French).
