2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/toulnoreast.htm#RobertIUzesdied1349
2 CONT
2 CONT a)       '''  ROBERT''' [I] d’Uzès (-after 28 Mar 1349).  Seigneur d’Uzès.  Vicomte d’Uzès 1328.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly (Papal dispensation 17 Dec 1305) DOUCELINE de Sabran, daughter of ELZEAR de Sabran Seigneur d’Ansouis & his wife Cécile d’Agoult (-after 18 Jul 1317).  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly (1320) as her second husband, GUYOTTE de Posquières Dame de Bellegarde et de Broussan, widow of GUIGUES [III] Seigneur de Roche-en-Régnier, daughter of RAYMOND Decan de Posquières Seigneur de Bellegarde et de Brou
2 CONC sson [Uzès] & his wife Simone du Caylar (-after 13 Jul 1354).  
2 CONT
2 CONT   Robert [I] & his first wife had children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *i)          CECILE d’Uzès (-after 17 Feb 1337).  The testament of “Pierre Isoard chevalier seigneur d’Aix fils de Guillaume Artaud et de Flotte de Sassenage”, dated 4 Dec 1334, acknowledged receiving “la dot de sa femme Cécile et
2 CONC  lui laisse le château de Beaumont”[1557].  m firstly as his second wife, PIERRE Isoard [II] Seigneur d’Aix, son of GUILLAUME Artaud [II] Seigneur d’Aix & his wife Flotte de Sassenage (-after 4 Dec 1334, bur Die Franciscan church)
2 CONC .  m secondly ([1336]) BERTRAND de Budos Seigneur de Montclus, son of --- (-after 2 Jun 1336). 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Robert [I] & his second wife had children: 
2 CONT
2 CONT *ii)         DECAN d’Uzès (-[1371/22 Apr 1374]).  Vicomte d’Uzès.  -         see below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT *iii)        GUYOTTE d’Uzés (end 1332-1399 or after).  The testament of "dame Guiote d’Usais veuve d’Aimar de Poitiers" is dated 1399[1558].  '''m''' firstly (11 Mar 1346) as his second wife, LOUIS de la Cerda Comte de Clermont, s
2 CONC on of ALFONSO de la Cerda de Castilla, Señor de Alba, Bejar y Gibraleón & his wife Mathilde de Brienne-Eu (in France [1291]-La Motte du Rhône 5 Jul 1348). ''' m''' secondly (5 Apr 1361) AYMAR de Poitiers Seigneur de Chalançon, son
2 CONC  of AYMAR [V] de Poitiers Comte de Valentinois et de Diois & his second wife Sibylle de Baux (-31 Oct 1366). 
