2 CONT ===Disputed origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Lady-Anne-de-Ferrers/6000000003649650067?through=6000000002043232172 & https://www.geni.com/people/Maud-Ferrers/6000000001563396772?through=6000000003649650067 are seen as children of https://www.geni.c
2 CONC om/people/Sir-William-de-Ferrers-of-Groby/6000000003649647674 and https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-le-Despenser/6000000002043232172?through=6000000003649647674 and have been disconnected from both as their children.  There are no 
2 CONC sources offered.  [EH, 18 April 2022] 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.geni.com/people/Maud-Ferrers/6000000001563396772 shown as wife of https://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Berkeley/6000000001579016395?through=6000000001563396772 the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Matilda-de-Ferrers/6
2 CONC 000000000424646588?through=6000000000395198564 ?  They share a death date of March 12, 1298.  [YES.  Merged and detached from Thomas Berkeley.]
