2 CONT
2 CONT Vicomte Guy [VI] & his first wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i)          '''MARGUERITE''' (after 1243-[Jul 1252/Aug 1263]).  Her parentage is confirmed by the testament of [her paternal aunt] “la vicomtesse Marguerite”, dated Jul 1252, which made a bequest to "Marguerite sa nièce, fille de 
2 CONC Guy son frère pour la faire religieuse"[704].  She was presumably born after the episode of her mother’s fake pregnancy, recounted above, and died before her father. 
