2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleanor de Warenne was born circa 1244 at Surrey, England.2 She was the daughter of Sir John de Warenne, 7th Earl of Surrey and Alice de Lusignan.1 She married Sir Henry de Percy, son of William de Percy, 6th Baron Percy and 
2 CONC Joan de Briwere, on 8 September 1268 at York, Yorkshire, England.1 She died after 1282.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Eleanor de Warenne was also known as Eleanor Plantagenet.2 From 8 September 1268, her married name became de Percy.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Eleanor de Warenne and Sir Henry de Percy
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Henry de Percy, 1st Lord Percy+ b. c 25 Mar 1273, d. bt 2 Oct 1314 - 10 Oct 13141
2 CONT
