2 CONT
2 CONT Banoile de Grandison  formerly Tour  aka de la Tour, de Gerenstein  Born 1233 in Gerenstein, Switzerland    Daughter of [father unknown] and [mother unknown]  [sibling(s) unknown]  Wife of Amadeus S de Grandison  - married [date u
2 CONC nknown] [location unknown]  [children unknown] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Research notes  This profile was originally attached to Albert IV de la Tour du Pin and Béatrix de Coligny as parents.  But Albert IV de la Tour du Pin and his wife Béatrix de Coligny had no daughter named Benoîte (Bénédicte). The
2 CONC  closer it gets is Béatrice, and the husband does not match.  Consequently, "Banoile" has been detached from Albert and Beatrix. I have not been able to find sources of her parentage anywhere. I'm not sure she even existed. Rassin
2 CONC ot-1  14:12, 1 June 2017 (EDT) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources  Charles Cawley, Medieval Lands, Burgundy Kingdom and Viennois, Albert II de la Tour du Pin and descendants: http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/burgkvien.htm#AlbertIITourPindied1229  (consulté le 31 mai 2017)
