2 CONT
2 CONT In 1346, under the leadership of the Duke of Bourbon, he fought the English in Agen. On March 23, 1357 with the Lord of Témines, he was the guarantor of the truce concluded in Bordeaux between the kings of France and England. (Gen
2 CONC eral history of Languedoc, Dom Vaissette)
