2 CONT == Marriage ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Lennox, here treated, married, about 1406, to Sir John Stewart, son and heir of Sir Alexander Stewart of Darnley. It has hitherto been assumed, for there was no definite proof, that Elizabeth was married to John Stewa
2 CONC rt in 1392, but it now appears that the dispensation for their marriage was not granted till 23 September 1406. He was, however, her second husband, as she was a widow in 1406. [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluo
2 CONC ft/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/341/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 341]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/scotspeeragefoun05pauluoft/page/341/mode/1up The Scots Peerage V: 341]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
