1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00164729&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/burgkgenev.htm#EleonoreGeneveMBertrandBauxOrange
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         ELEONORE (-after 21 Jul 1314).  "Guido…Lingon. Ep." withdrew his claim against "R…Gebenn. Ep…fratri nostro" relating to the dowries of "Henricus de Gebenn…frater noster…Beatricem et Elienort filias legitimas dicti Henri
2 CONC ci" by charter dated 13 Oct 1278[156].  The primary source which confirms her marriage has not yet been identified.   The testament of "Bertrand de Baux IV prince d’Orange", dated 21 Jul 1314, bequeathed property to “...Eléonore s
2 CONC on épouse...”[157].  
2 CONT
