2 CONT Ramón IV BÉRENGAR Comte de Provence 	Born: 1198, Aix-En-Provence, Bouches-Du-Rhone, France 	Married: 5 Jun 1219, Dez, France  	Died: 19 Aug 1245, Aix-En-Provence, Bouches-Du-Rhone, France 
