1 CONT
1 CONT William IV Taillefer, Comte d'Angoulême was the son of Wulgrin II Taillefer, Comte d'Angoulême and Ponse de Montgomery. He died on 7 August 1177.
1 CONT      William IV Taillefer, Comte d'Angoulême gained the title of Comte d'Angoulême.
1 CONT Child of William IV Taillefer, Comte d'Angoulême and Margaret de Turenne
