1 CONT Joan (?)+ b. b 1195, d. 12378
1 CONT Children of John I 'Lackland', King of England and Isabella d'Angoulême
1 CONT Henry III, King of England+ b. 1 Oct 1207, d. 16 Nov 1272
1 CONT Richard, 1st Earl of Cornwall+ b. 5 Jan 1209, d. 2 Apr 12729
