0 @N6000000002187590249@ NOTE John of England
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT John 
1 CONT By the Grace of God, King of England, Lord of Ireland, Duke of Normandy and Aquitaine and Count of Anjou 
1 CONT
1 CONT Reign April 6, 1199 – October 18/19, 1216 
1 CONT Coronation May 27, 1199 
1 CONT Born December 24, 1167 
1 CONT  Beaumont Palace, Oxford 
1 CONT Died October 18 / 19, 1216 
1 CONT  Newark 
1 CONT Buried Worcester Cathedral 
1 CONT Predecessor Richard I 
1 CONT Successor Henry III 
1 CONT Consort Isabella of Angouleme
1 CONT (c. 1187–1246) 
1 CONT Issue Henry III (1207–1272)
1 CONT Richard, 1st Earl of Cornwall
1 CONT (1209–1272)
1 CONT Joan of England (1210–1238)
1 CONT Isabella of England (1214–1241)
