1 CONT on 24 June 1340 and died on 3  Feb.   1399.  He  married Katherine, a d/o
1 CONT Payne Roelt, as his  third  wife. Their  daughter:
1 CONT GEN. 5 Joan Roelt married, being his second wife, Ralph de Neville,   who
1 CONT was a  Knight  of the Garter and the first Earl of  Westmorland   (1364-
