1 CONT [Tom Lincoln]  Joan NEVILLE (b. abt 1443 in Oversley, Warwickshire,
1 CONT Eng).  Joan NEVILLE led to her grand parents: Ralph de NEVILLE [Earl of
1 CONT Westmorland] (b. 1364 in Castle Raby, Raby, Durham, Eng; d. 21 Oct   1425
