0 @N6000000000437091867@ NOTE Name Prefix:<NPFX> Marquis Name Suffix:<NSFX> Iii, Of Barcelona Ramon Berenguer III was Count of Barcelona, Girona, and Osona from 1097-1131. He was the son of Ramon Berenguer II , and became count when his uncle Berenguer Ramon I
