1 CONT of Margaret of Austria, daughter of Maximilian and Mary. Charles, as an
1 CONT infant, had been set up to marry Margaret by his father, so he, in effect,
1 CONT forfeited those rights and properties. Anne of Brittany was also married to
1 CONT Maximilian I by proxy in 1490. The marriage was severed later by Charles VIII.
