0 @N6000000002176643639@ NOTE He succeeded his father as King of naples, succeeded in turn by his
1 CONT granddaughter Joanna I, Queen of Naples 1343-1382, who adopted Louis of
1 CONT Anjou. Robert was an Anevin prince and Guelf (papal party) leader whose early
1 CONT years were clouded by the Sicilian Vespers (1282-1288) in which his father,
1 CONT Charles II of Anjou, was taken prisoner by the Aragonese. Robert took
1 CONT Charles's place as hostage. Later, Robert led an expedition attempting to
1 CONT recover Sicily from the Aragonese prince who ruled as Frederick III.
